              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.10+EXO.25.11+EXO.25.12+EXO.25.13+EXO.25.14+EXO.25.15+EXO.25.16+EXO.25.17+EXO.25.18+EXO.25.19+EXO.25.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 25:10-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besaleli abāza isandugu mu giti citwa umushita: uburebure bgayo bg’umurambararo bgar’ amatambge abiri n’igice y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ubgaguke bgayo bgar’ itambge rimwe n’igice, uburebure bg’igihagararo bgar’ itambge rimwe n’igice nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayomekakw izahabu iramuye imbere n’inyuma, ayikīkūzak’ umuguno w’izahabu impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avugutira izahabu, ayikūramw’ ibigombo bine vyo kuyitērako, abitēra ku maguru yayo ukw ar’ ane, ibigombo bibiri biba ku ruhande rumwe, bindi bibiri biba ku rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abāza iminiho mu mushita, ayomekakw izahabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "araheza yinjiza iyo miniho yo kurerura iyo sandugu mur’ ivyo bigombo vyo ku mpande zayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acura n’umutemere wo guhongerako mw izahabu iramuye; uburebure bgawo bg’ umurambararo bgar’ amatambge abiri n’igihimba y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ubgaguke bgawo bgar’ itambge rimwe n’igihimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akora abakerubi babiri mw izahabu, mu mitwe yompi y’uwo mutemere wo guhongerako, abakoze mu buryo bgo gucura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukerubi umwe amukora mu mutwe umwe, uwundi amukora mu wundi; abo bakerubi abashamika kur’ uwo mutemere wo guhongerako mu mitwe yawo yompi, baba kimwe na wo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakerubi bari bashanje amababa hejuru, ayo mababa yabo yar’ akingiye uwo mutemere wo guhongerako, bārarābana; bari bashize amaso kur’ uwo mutemere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
