                "loc": "EXO.30.1+EXO.30.2+EXO.30.3+EXO.30.4+EXO.30.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 30:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abāza igicaniro co kwoserezakw imibavu mu giti citwa umushita; uburebure bgaco bgar’ itambge rimwe ry’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ubgaguke bgar’ itambge rimwe nyene: cangana impande zose; uburebure bgaco bg’igihagararo bgar’ amatambge abiri; amahembe yaco yar’ abāziwe kuri co, yari kimwe na co. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acomekakw izahabu iramuye, hejuru kuri co, no mu mbavu zaco impande zose, no ku mahembe yaco; agikīkūzak’ umuguno w’izahabu impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musi y’uwo muguno waco, ahahera mu mbavu zaco zompi, agicurira ibigombo bibiri‐bibiri vy’ izahabu; abitēra mu mpande zaco zompi, biba ivyo kwinjizamw’ iminiho yo kukirerura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abāza iminiho mu giti c’umushita, ayomekakw izahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
